+## Entity tenancy
+
+Implemented in the `2026_10_29_*` migrations, with `App\Models\Entity`, `App\Models\EntityMembership`, `App\Models\UserRole` and the policies `App\Policies\EntityPolicy` and `App\Policies\EntityMembershipPolicy`.
