+| Table | Columns | Constraints |
+| ----- | ------- | ----------- |
+| `entities` | `id`, `name`, `slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at` | `slug` unique (`entities_slug_unique`) |
+| `entity_memberships` | `id`, `entity_id` FK, `user_id` FK, `role` (default `employee`), `owner_seq` (generated), `created_at`, `updated_at` | FKs cascade on delete; `(entity_id, user_id)` unique; `(entity_id, owner_seq)` unique (`entity_memberships_one_owner`) |
